 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "53 (the hypocrites exposed) under a night sky with no motif. Light for «ويحبونه», geometric for «إنما وليكم الله». No people, no fighting drawn. STAGING v4: 53: a town at dusk; believers speak among themselves (Al-Muyassar: some believers to others) on 53:2 and point at three men (the hypocrites) on 53:4; the men lower their heads on 53:12 and turn their hands over on 53:14 (their deeds void, the loss); a leaf plate for the void deeds. 54-55: the town is empty during the conditional of 54:4-8 (two-paths plate only, nobody shown turning back); the group of believers appears on 54:12 (the people Allah brings), lowers their heads on 54:15 (humble toward the believers); nothing is drawn for striving (54:21-24) or for the stern side; a mountain plate on 54:26 (not fearing blame), a sparkle on 54:30 (the favour), geometric for the closing names and 55:1-4. Nobody bows while the Messenger is named (55:4). 55:8 the believers stand in prayer; 55:9 two other believers enter (never a lone man at the centre after the Messenger is named) and give a purse to a poor man on 55:10; the camera then closes on the praying rows (55:11), which bow on 55:13 with the givers out of frame, so no one gives while bowing. Geometric (not light) for 54:13-14."
 },
